WEBVTT

00:00:34.480 --> 00:00:34.920
Mm-hmm.

00:01:00.160 --> 00:01:00.200
Thank you.

00:02:07.770 --> 00:02:08.850
Don't be so greedy.

00:02:09.980 --> 00:02:13.040
Thanks to you, we've had to turn all our fields into carrot fields, you know.

00:02:18.340 --> 00:02:21.380
What's the matter?

00:02:22.500 --> 00:02:25.530
Oh, it's only snow.

00:02:25.960 --> 00:02:26.540
That's all.

00:02:27.790 --> 00:02:29.970
So, this is the first time you've ever seen snow.

00:03:07.230 --> 00:03:14.320
Now, this is what I call heaven on earth.

00:03:16.770 --> 00:03:20.380
Hey, how about a drink?

00:03:21.080 --> 00:03:22.300
No, I don't think so.

00:03:23.890 --> 00:03:24.970
Join me, huh?

00:03:25.460 --> 00:03:25.960
Ugh.

00:03:30.440 --> 00:03:33.380
Wow, you sure know how to put this stuff away

00:03:34.460 --> 00:03:40.820
Let me remind you I haven't quite forgiven you for that incident the other day. Well, come on

00:03:40.820 --> 00:03:46.580
What are you telling me you're still upset about that? I'm certainly sorry that you couldn't seduce Tenchi

00:03:49.210 --> 00:03:55.320
You see Tenchi and I are related by noble blood

00:03:55.510 --> 00:03:59.350
I'm not like you

00:04:00.380 --> 00:04:02.640
Yeah, but it's only been two months since you two met.

00:04:03.350 --> 00:04:06.410
I, on the other hand, have known him since he was this tiny.

00:04:07.410 --> 00:04:09.370
He sure was a cutie pie.

00:04:10.310 --> 00:04:11.450
He sure was.

00:04:22.360 --> 00:04:23.700
Tenshi, do you see a monster?

00:04:26.160 --> 00:04:26.720
Hey, Tenshi.

00:04:28.100 --> 00:04:29.060
Oh, Grandma.

00:04:29.640 --> 00:04:29.980
Did I...

00:04:30.000 --> 00:04:30.680
Did I surprise you?

00:04:30.840 --> 00:04:32.380
Yeah, I thought you were grandpa!

00:05:00.190 --> 00:05:00.950
Tenshi!

00:05:02.260 --> 00:05:02.720
I'm coming!

00:05:05.290 --> 00:05:08.350
I always hoped that one day Tenshi and I would play together.

00:05:08.810 --> 00:05:14.500
But now he treats me like I'm some sort of monster or something.

00:05:14.760 --> 00:05:17.560
So of course I tease him sometimes.

00:05:17.800 --> 00:05:19.100
You understand, don't you?

00:05:21.690 --> 00:05:21.890
Hmm?

00:05:25.600 --> 00:05:27.820
For darling, you were a mummy.

00:05:29.250 --> 00:05:29.970
Tenshi just doesn't-

00:05:30.090 --> 00:05:35.840
to play with a monster thanks for the sympathy well let's be honest shall we you're wondering

00:05:35.840 --> 00:05:41.210
why he treats you like he does i think i know the problem i'm pretty sure the problem is your

00:05:41.210 --> 00:05:49.810
age you're over a thousand years old and it's annoying to be seduced by an old lady just look

00:05:49.810 --> 00:05:59.370
at my beautiful skin so youthful and yours is so well soaking too long i hate you

00:06:00.760 --> 00:06:05.430
Am I disturbing you?

00:06:07.990 --> 00:06:08.470
Hello?

00:06:09.500 --> 00:06:12.110
How long have you been there?

00:06:12.760 --> 00:06:14.500
Are you talking about Tenshi?

00:06:15.110 --> 00:06:17.350
I hope it's okay if I make myself comfortable.

00:06:18.090 --> 00:06:28.230
The moment when I heard that it was Tenshi who saved me when I was just about to be sucked into a black hole,

00:06:28.820 --> 00:06:29.100
when...

00:06:30.220 --> 00:06:39.720
heard that he just might be my destiny yes that's what I thought he might be my destiny

00:06:42.130 --> 00:06:58.580
you were just met and I'm talking to you like this you're the only one who understands my feelings

00:07:09.520 --> 00:07:15.480
I finally found you, Ryoko.

00:07:16.170 --> 00:07:16.730
Kagato.

00:07:44.480 --> 00:07:55.490
This one's a real one, the infamous brutal criminal, Kagato, eternal and most wanted

00:07:55.490 --> 00:07:56.590
criminal Kagato.

00:07:58.090 --> 00:07:59.710
Come out now, I know you're here.

00:08:01.080 --> 00:08:17.430
Please excuse my behavior earlier. I deeply appreciate you coming out to welcome me.

00:08:20.410 --> 00:08:20.770
Ryoko!

00:08:21.720 --> 00:08:27.480
However, this one belongs to me. She is, how can I say it delicately, waste product.

00:08:27.720 --> 00:08:29.970
Still, she is agile. I bet she's giving-

00:08:30.000 --> 00:08:37.670
you some trouble, Princess Asami, Princess Ayeka. Don't you think it's best we talk someplace

00:08:37.670 --> 00:08:40.830
private? Someplace where there's no one to bother us?

00:08:42.830 --> 00:08:48.450
Magato, I will arrest you! This is a specially protected area. Any kind of combative action

00:08:48.450 --> 00:08:52.070
is forbidden. If you involve any civilian, I'll blast you to bits!

00:08:54.060 --> 00:08:59.530
Ayoma, you really frighten me. You see, I've heard much of your heroic episodes in the

00:08:59.530 --> 00:08:59.810
past.

00:09:00.440 --> 00:09:03.440
Now, I hear you're overworked, and your performance stinks.

00:09:14.550 --> 00:09:17.070
Please, I don't wish for you to misunderstand me.

00:09:17.170 --> 00:09:19.710
I've only come here to invite you all to my ship, the Soja.

00:09:20.090 --> 00:09:23.390
Hmm, very pleasant place. A place where we can get to know one another.

00:09:27.080 --> 00:09:29.380
Oh, I see you have the sword.

00:09:30.640 --> 00:09:35.460
But that's the king's property. Wave it around like that and you're going to hurt yourself, young man.

00:09:36.150 --> 00:09:37.310
What do you mean? What king?

00:09:37.770 --> 00:09:40.850
You would fight me without full knowledge of the sword?

00:09:42.120 --> 00:09:42.960
All right, then.

00:09:49.330 --> 00:09:53.650
Laste your life. Now just hand me that sword.

00:09:54.350 --> 00:09:54.870
Tenshi!

00:10:02.080 --> 00:10:06.700
Fascinating. And what about that boy interests you so much, Ryoko?

00:10:10.100 --> 00:10:10.680
Ryoko!

00:10:16.140 --> 00:10:19.170
His set sword holds the greatest energy in the universe,

00:10:19.310 --> 00:10:24.050
but the sword will only release that energy when held by a suitable owner.

00:10:24.770 --> 00:10:27.960
My question is, are you that suitable owner?

00:10:28.710 --> 00:10:29.430
Maybe I am.

00:10:31.120 --> 00:10:35.480
I'll ask you again. Are you a suitable owner of that sword?

00:10:36.780 --> 00:10:38.940
Please, sir! Let Ryoko go!

00:11:00.480 --> 00:11:01.500
I'll test you.

00:11:02.720 --> 00:11:21.390
This is no fun.

00:11:21.650 --> 00:11:23.930
Do you enjoy making me waste my time?

00:11:37.130 --> 00:11:39.770
Are you playing with something that doesn't belong to you?

00:11:41.260 --> 00:11:41.740
Grandfather.

00:11:43.660 --> 00:11:45.880
Ryoko, I'll give you one more chance.

00:11:49.900 --> 00:11:54.080
There you are, the first crown prince of Jirai's royal family.

00:11:54.180 --> 00:11:57.100
I wonder, could you show me the secret of the universe?

00:11:57.280 --> 00:11:58.340
Will you share that treasure?

00:11:58.650 --> 00:11:59.130
Pleasure?

00:12:00.000 --> 00:12:03.000
Well, I do know of a really comfortable hot spring nearby.

00:12:06.190 --> 00:12:08.560
Well, are we cocky?

00:12:13.370 --> 00:12:15.350
Greatest energy in the universe?

00:12:16.050 --> 00:12:17.330
There's no such thing.

00:12:18.190 --> 00:12:21.570
And if there were, it couldn't be controlled by humans.

00:12:22.510 --> 00:12:26.810
I have journeyed through sea after sea of the stars in order to find the secret.

00:12:27.220 --> 00:12:29.160
What will it take to get that power?

00:12:29.430 --> 00:12:29.970
Your blood?

00:12:30.000 --> 00:12:32.690
Dry royal family's blood?

00:13:13.630 --> 00:13:20.820
Using a woman as a shield? Coward!

00:13:23.840 --> 00:13:25.570
Yoko, wake up! Wake up!

00:13:32.010 --> 00:13:59.830
Grandpa doing have you given up?

00:14:10.200 --> 00:14:12.180
It's not yours, eh?

00:14:17.280 --> 00:14:21.940
See, this boy is your successor.

00:14:23.840 --> 00:14:24.320
Tenshi.

00:14:26.880 --> 00:14:27.600
Ryoko!

00:14:28.050 --> 00:14:29.970
I will take your precious Ryoko with-

00:14:30.000 --> 00:14:33.880
May improve your skills, then come to us. I'll be waiting for you!

00:14:44.940 --> 00:14:47.440
Sorry, I... I... I guess now you know.

00:14:48.490 --> 00:14:48.910
I...

00:14:50.120 --> 00:14:52.080
Easy now, don't scold me!

00:15:02.300 --> 00:15:05.900
What happened to him changed so much.

00:15:08.820 --> 00:15:09.320
Alda?

00:15:09.610 --> 00:15:10.230
Don't cry.

00:15:10.940 --> 00:15:13.120
Aieka, I was not going to tell you this.

00:15:13.180 --> 00:15:15.620
But if I had stayed on planet Shirai,

00:15:15.800 --> 00:15:18.340
there would have been a conflict between you and me

00:15:18.340 --> 00:15:20.420
over succession to the throne.

00:15:21.440 --> 00:15:24.770
Aieka, you see, my mother was an Earthling,

00:15:25.760 --> 00:15:28.920
and I am too, or at least half of me.

00:15:30.160 --> 00:15:31.400
But why should that matter?

00:15:34.030 --> 00:15:38.190
Father made the law of him.

00:15:39.390 --> 00:15:41.190
We should mix with blood of other planets.

00:15:41.410 --> 00:15:43.990
It was a law that many Jurayans didn't like.

00:15:45.540 --> 00:15:47.820
In those days, there was tremendous prejudice.

00:15:48.340 --> 00:15:50.240
I... I could not bear it.

00:15:52.070 --> 00:15:53.870
So when we were attacked by Ryoko,

00:15:54.210 --> 00:15:56.900
I left to fight, never to return.

00:15:57.590 --> 00:15:59.290
Now this planet is my home.

00:16:00.000 --> 00:16:01.900
And this is where I wish to be buried.

00:16:02.540 --> 00:16:05.260
I have no intention of returning to Jirai.

00:16:05.920 --> 00:16:09.400
But without Jirai, without its life tree and water...

00:16:09.590 --> 00:16:12.620
I will die. I know that, Aika.

00:16:12.920 --> 00:16:14.580
And such a thing doesn't matter.

00:16:15.240 --> 00:16:16.800
Someday you will understand.

00:16:17.920 --> 00:16:20.140
Then it's true, Grandpa. You're Yoshio.

00:16:21.320 --> 00:16:24.360
And the stories, the legend, all of it is true.

00:16:24.920 --> 00:16:28.520
Yes, and you are crowned prince of planet Jirai.

00:16:28.820 --> 00:16:29.740
You look surprised.

00:16:30.280 --> 00:16:31.700
But you never said a thing.

00:16:31.900 --> 00:16:33.360
And if I had, what then?

00:16:34.010 --> 00:16:35.790
Would you have known what to do?

00:16:37.200 --> 00:16:40.500
Silly boy, now is your time to grasp the future.

00:16:41.860 --> 00:16:42.700
I am sorry.

00:16:42.700 --> 00:16:45.620
I had no idea your heart was set on me.

00:16:46.330 --> 00:16:47.270
I've got an idea.

00:16:47.530 --> 00:16:48.850
We could get married now.

00:16:49.190 --> 00:16:49.850
What do you think?

00:16:50.540 --> 00:16:51.980
Please, don't make fun!

00:16:52.100 --> 00:16:53.320
You're right, you're right.

00:16:53.420 --> 00:16:54.160
I'm too old.

00:16:54.300 --> 00:16:56.700
But Tenshi, however, is about the right age.

00:16:56.980 --> 00:16:58.820
He's a very good grandson.

00:17:01.630 --> 00:17:03.430
You two are perfect together.

00:17:15.140 --> 00:17:17.400
So touching, I can't help it.

00:17:19.760 --> 00:17:23.540
Grandpa, I have to save Ryoko, but...

00:17:24.080 --> 00:17:25.700
But she's the cause of all our trouble.

00:17:25.920 --> 00:17:27.880
You certainly don't have to save her.

00:17:29.420 --> 00:17:29.820
Tenchi.

00:17:30.190 --> 00:17:31.590
I will give you that sword.

00:17:32.340 --> 00:17:33.900
Kagato is very dangerous.

00:17:34.380 --> 00:17:36.480
You must go and defeat him.

00:17:36.940 --> 00:17:38.760
In order to get hold of the secret treasure,

00:17:38.980 --> 00:17:41.520
he would think nothing of destroying this planet.

00:17:42.580 --> 00:17:43.760
But can I defeat him?

00:17:44.590 --> 00:17:45.590
I don't know, Grandpa.

00:17:45.710 --> 00:17:48.730
I have a hard enough time handling that sword.

00:17:48.750 --> 00:17:51.830
With that kind of attitude, how do you expect to protect these women?

00:17:52.750 --> 00:17:55.690
You have a power that hasn't been awakened yet.

00:17:56.620 --> 00:17:57.660
Trust yourself.

00:17:58.500 --> 00:17:59.970
Grandpa, I...

00:18:00.000 --> 00:18:00.600
understand

00:18:04.010 --> 00:18:29.640
Listen now for every man. There's a time when he must fight or does acknowledge ten. She has

00:18:31.470 --> 00:18:43.740
Are you going, Tenchi? With the sword you can't quite handle yet? Even so, are you still going?

00:18:43.960 --> 00:18:55.400
Hmm. Yoko, must save her. Thank you.

00:18:56.900 --> 00:18:58.580
Let's be police. It is my duty.

00:19:04.120 --> 00:19:05.820
Aika, please take care of Grandpa.

00:19:06.160 --> 00:19:07.760
Okay, how are we going to get there?

00:19:08.170 --> 00:19:08.430
Really?

00:19:16.060 --> 00:19:16.240
Okay.

00:19:34.440 --> 00:19:35.380
What's the matter with him?

00:19:38.860 --> 00:19:39.260
HEEE!

00:20:01.020 --> 00:20:09.940
I guess we can use that to travel in, huh?

00:20:10.420 --> 00:20:23.120
Here they come.

00:20:25.580 --> 00:20:26.200
It's strange.

00:20:26.800 --> 00:20:29.980
They are coming here to throw away their lives to save someone as defective.

00:20:30.000 --> 00:20:32.360
as you. I am not your

00:20:32.360 --> 00:20:35.010
machine anymore. I am a human

00:20:35.010 --> 00:20:36.740
being. Human being?

00:20:37.840 --> 00:20:40.220
And compared to the infinite will of the universe,

00:20:40.560 --> 00:20:42.080
human feelings amount to little

00:20:42.080 --> 00:20:43.960
nothing more than dust.

00:20:44.160 --> 00:20:46.480
You know, your current form was

00:20:46.480 --> 00:20:48.180
chosen only because it was convenient.

00:20:48.910 --> 00:20:50.510
Your original form could have been anything

00:20:50.510 --> 00:20:53.650
that I wanted. Like a stone.

00:20:54.460 --> 00:20:56.200
Shall I turn you into a stone? Would that

00:20:56.200 --> 00:20:56.960
make you happy?

00:21:00.510 --> 00:21:04.430
I'd love to stay and chat, but I'd better prepare to welcome our guests.

00:21:08.640 --> 00:21:12.480
FUNCHI, YOU'LL BE SORRY! I SWEAR IT! YOU'LL BE SORRY!

00:21:26.300 --> 00:21:29.860
He's about to attack. Avoid it.

00:21:30.670 --> 00:21:34.200
I can't believe you, but I really don't know what I'm doing!

00:21:40.180 --> 00:21:40.680
Sh!

00:22:00.000 --> 00:22:00.540
Excuse me.

00:22:02.580 --> 00:22:03.600
We're doing well.

00:22:04.350 --> 00:22:05.810
One is different from all the others.

00:22:05.910 --> 00:22:07.330
Do you happen to know how it works?

00:22:07.470 --> 00:22:07.630
No.

00:22:08.310 --> 00:22:08.570
Don't.

00:22:08.910 --> 00:22:10.590
But I command you to figure it out right.

00:22:15.240 --> 00:22:18.040
I am the one who built the ship that you are in.

00:22:19.030 --> 00:22:23.850
Every move you make, you know I will see through it.

00:22:46.040 --> 00:22:46.400
We'll see it.

00:23:00.160 --> 00:23:03.260
Yeah, well, don't have very much to do.

00:23:03.600 --> 00:23:12.520
Now, that's a very capable evasion.

00:23:13.110 --> 00:23:15.550
I wonder if it's due to the power of the boy's sword.

00:23:16.030 --> 00:23:17.690
Ayaka, we need to do something.

00:23:17.850 --> 00:23:19.090
Can we attack from your ship?

00:23:19.820 --> 00:23:24.010
It is possible, but I'm not sure the ship is fully formed yet.

00:23:24.370 --> 00:23:25.420
It's dangerous.

00:23:26.190 --> 00:23:28.210
Well, we can't just sit here and do nothing.

00:23:29.310 --> 00:23:29.970
I will.

00:23:30.000 --> 00:23:37.990
go no you can't it's my responsibility once I get there you'll have to direct

00:23:37.990 --> 00:23:53.100
me Baker I'm ready first you must open the light hawk we light hawk wings the

00:23:53.540 --> 00:23:58.340
shield for that craft its original function is a defense however you can

00:23:58.340 --> 00:23:59.440
use it to attack also

00:24:00.830 --> 00:24:02.010
It isn't meant for that purpose.

00:24:02.460 --> 00:24:03.460
We will be vulnerable.

00:24:05.070 --> 00:24:06.190
It's our only hope.

00:24:06.580 --> 00:24:08.100
How do I open the wings, Aika?

00:24:08.400 --> 00:24:08.880
Whoa!

00:24:09.720 --> 00:24:10.900
Tell me what to do!

00:24:22.980 --> 00:24:24.260
Using the Lighthawk wings.

00:24:24.260 --> 00:24:25.580
I'm very impressed.

00:24:26.360 --> 00:24:28.480
Gerai's royal family is powerful indeed,

00:24:28.840 --> 00:24:29.980
but I have a suitable...

00:24:30.000 --> 00:24:30.600
strategy

00:25:30.000 --> 00:25:31.640
Ha ha ha ha!

00:26:47.640 --> 00:26:55.590
Gagato, Gagato, you have stolen the one that was most precious to me, and I will make you pay.

00:26:59.020 --> 00:26:59.860
YOU WILL PAY!

00:27:30.700 --> 00:27:30.960
We'll see you next time.

00:28:37.580 --> 00:28:37.780
It's me.
